    "text": "BY virtue of the powers vested in me by Section 27 (1) of the Universities Act, No. 16 of 1978, I, Lakshman Kiriella,Minister of Higher Education and Highways, do by this Order, on the recommendation of the University Grants Commission,amend the Schedule to the Order made under Section 21 of the said Act, establishing the South Eastern University of SriLanka, published in Gazette Extraordinary, No. 916/7 of March 27, 1996 (as last amended by Order published in GazetteExtraordinary, No. 1906/6 of March, 16, 2015) by the addition immediately after item (d) appearing in Column II underthe heading \u201cDepartment of study\u201d which corresponds to the entry \u201cFaculty of Arts and Culture\u201d appearing in Column Iunder the heading \u201cFaculty\u201d of the Schedule II to such Order, of the following item :-",
